      "text": "Repository development practice: gotchas.md instructs maintainers that worker-brief.md is the single source for the checklist, materiality gate, and return format, that duplicated lists must never be re-added to SKILL.md, and that the skill description must lead with 'Use when' triggers rather than summarizing the workflow."
